sequenceDiagram
    actor Tester
    participant Panel as Test Panel
    participant App as Laravel
    participant MN as mNotify API
    actor Customer
    participant Hook as mNotify Webhook Adapter
    participant Engine as ConversationEngine
    Note over Tester,Engine: LATER PHASE - IVR via mNotify (outbound first, inbound on same webhook)
    Tester->>Panel: 1. Launch outbound call for a customer
    Panel->>App: 2. create CallSession (channel ivr, direction outbound)
    App->>MN: 3. POST /initiate-ivr-call (fromNumber, toNumber, uuid, uniqueId)
    MN->>Customer: 4. phone rings, customer answers
    MN->>Hook: 5. GET callback (CallerId, SequenceID, IsStarting, context outbound)
    Hook->>Engine: 6. startCall - same engine as browser
    Hook-->>MN: 7. background action - 8 kHz prompt audio URL, keypad can interrupt
    MN->>Hook: 8. GET callback (DTMF) or after record action (recordingUrl)
    Hook->>Engine: 9. handleInput or handleSpeech (download, ffmpeg, Khaya)
    Hook-->>MN: 10. background, get_digits, record, playback or hangup
    Note over MN,Engine: STAGE 2 - speak to an agent returns dial action to a staff number
